{"2464210": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Stonebound", "steam_appid": 2464210, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Reclaim Your Heritage</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have discovered the remains of Stone Hold, the long lost dwarven home of legend. Reclaim and rebuild, unlocking the power of your forebears. Can you restore the Dwarves to their former glory?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2464210/extras/e8bc13da9864cb318b62d522baa692b3.poster.avif?t=1785136643\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2464210/extras/e8bc13da9864cb318b62d522baa692b3.webm?t=1785136643\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2464210/extras/e8bc13da9864cb318b62d522baa692b3.mp4?t=1785136643\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Mine The Mountain</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dig out valuable ore and gems that lie in the rock. Build and supply your workshops and turn rare materials into the finest wares. Improve your equipment, laying rails as your push deeper. Attract traders to your Hold, and rebuild the wealth and prosperity now lost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2464210/extras/a040e342126b661dab49ee65225ce840.poster.avif?t=1785136643\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2464210/extras/a040e342126b661dab49ee65225ce840.webm?t=1785136643\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2464210/extras/a040e342126b661dab49ee65225ce840.mp4?t=1785136643\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build Your Hold</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Layout your plans and watch your dwarves deliver resources and build! Increase the renown of your Hold, attracting more of your brethren to your cause.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2464210/extras/72e6960349b2b66497c049e16d82da87.poster.avif?t=1785136643\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2464210/extras/72e6960349b2b66497c049e16d82da87.webm?t=1785136643\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2464210/extras/72e6960349b2b66497c049e16d82da87.mp4?t=1785136643\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dwarf Management</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep your dwarves housed, fed, and (most importantly) supplied with fine ales. From eating and sleeping on the ground, construct dwellings deep within the stone for the ultimate in dwarven luxury.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2464210/extras/ef9319c1ea69800e789306a36431092e.poster.avif?t=1785136643\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2464210/extras/ef9319c1ea69800e789306a36431092e.webm?t=1785136643\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2464210/extras/ef9319c1ea69800e789306a36431092e.mp4?t=1785136643\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Reclaim Your Heritage</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have discovered the remains of Stone Hold, the long lost dwarven home of legend. Reclaim and rebuild, unlocking the power of your forebears. Can you restore the Dwarves to their former glory?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2464210/extras/e8bc13da9864cb318b62d522baa692b3.poster.avif?t=1785136643\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2464210/extras/e8bc13da9864cb318b62d522baa692b3.webm?t=1785136643\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2464210/extras/e8bc13da9864cb318b62d522baa692b3.mp4?t=1785136643\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Mine The Mountain</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dig out valuable ore and gems that lie in the rock. Build and supply your workshops and turn rare materials into the finest wares. Improve your equipment, laying rails as your push deeper. Attract traders to your Hold, and rebuild the wealth and prosperity now lost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2464210/extras/a040e342126b661dab49ee65225ce840.poster.avif?t=1785136643\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2464210/extras/a040e342126b661dab49ee65225ce840.webm?t=1785136643\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2464210/extras/a040e342126b661dab49ee65225ce840.mp4?t=1785136643\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build Your Hold</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Layout your plans and watch your dwarves deliver resources and build! Increase the renown of your Hold, attracting more of your brethren to your cause.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2464210/extras/72e6960349b2b66497c049e16d82da87.poster.avif?t=1785136643\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2464210/extras/72e6960349b2b66497c049e16d82da87.webm?t=1785136643\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2464210/extras/72e6960349b2b66497c049e16d82da87.mp4?t=1785136643\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dwarf Management</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep your dwarves housed, fed, and (most importantly) supplied with fine ales. From eating and sleeping on the ground, construct dwellings deep within the stone for the ultimate in dwarven luxury.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2464210/extras/ef9319c1ea69800e789306a36431092e.poster.avif?t=1785136643\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2464210/extras/ef9319c1ea69800e789306a36431092e.webm?t=1785136643\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2464210/extras/ef9319c1ea69800e789306a36431092e.mp4?t=1785136643\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "Establish and grow a dwarven colony. Mine deep into the rock for precious ores and gems, then craft the finest wares to trade. Attract more dwarves as your renown spreads and your gold hoard increases.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2464210/7fb1671d832ab074d36951f91676c3ce16e54059/header.jpg?t=1785136643", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2464210/e74f6ed96157b187e0a3dae33dea8a1907fcb1ee/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1785136643", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2464210/e74f6ed96157b187e0a3dae33dea8a1907fcb1ee/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1785136643", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "linux_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "developers": ["Purple Button"], "publishers": ["Purple Button"], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 23, "description": "Steam Cloud"}, {"id": 62, "description": "Family Sharing"}], "genres": [{"id": "23", "description": "Indie"}, {"id": "3", "description": "RPG"}, {"id": "28", "description": "Simulation"}], "screensh